        "content": "<p>I would like to prove an instance of <code>CompleteAtomicBooleanAlgebra</code> as shown below, but got stuck on the last few goals.  The problem is that the goal contains notations like <code>⊓</code> and <code>⊔</code> but I've no idea how to access their definitions.  Identifiers like <code>inf</code> and <code>sup</code> are considered undefined by Lean, even though they appear just a few lines above.  Anyone knows how to solve this problem?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Order</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">CompleteBooleanAlgebra</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- An ω-language is a set of ω-sequences over an alphabet. -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"sd\">/-- The set of ω-sequences. -/</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Coe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">coe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Foo</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">ext</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ext</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">protected</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ext</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p2</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Foo</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instCompleteAtomicBooleanAlgebra</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CompleteAtomicBooleanAlgebra</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">bot</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨∅⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">top</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">univ</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">le</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊆</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">inf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">sup</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∪</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">compl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set</span><span class=\"bp\">ᶜ⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">sInf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ps</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨⋂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ps</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">sSup</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ps</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨⋃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ps</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">bot_le</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">le_top</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">le_refl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">le_trans</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">le_antisymm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">le_inf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">sup_le</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">le_sup_left</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">le_sup_right</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">inf_le_left</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">inf_le_right</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">le_sup_inf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">inf_compl_le_bot</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">top_le_sup_compl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">isLUB_sSup</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">isGLB_sInf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">iInf_iSup_eq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Foo</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The context of the above problem is that I would like to refactor cslib's <code>ωLanguage</code> to use a properly encapsulated implementation, instead of the current one:<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/cslib/blob/main/Cslib/Computability/Languages/OmegaLanguage.lean\">https://github.com/leanprover/cslib/blob/main/Cslib/Computability/Languages/OmegaLanguage.lean</a><br>\nwhich does not seem to play well with the recent <code>grind</code> change <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/13166\">lean4#13166</a>.</p>",
        "id": 584344259,
        "sender_full_name": "Ching-Tsun Chou",
        "timestamp": 1775697456
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Can you use the recently added <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Equiv.completeAtomicBooleanAlgebra#doc\">docs#Equiv.completeAtomicBooleanAlgebra</a> instead?</p>",
        "id": 584373471,
        "sender_full_name": "Yaël Dillies",
        "timestamp": 1775717797
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>See <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/36934\">#36934</a> for the similar change to the one you want to do, but for <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Language#doc\">docs#Language</a></p>",
        "id": 584373933,
        "sender_full_name": "Yaël Dillies",
        "timestamp": 1775717880
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Great!  I'll follow the example of <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/36934\">#36934</a>.  Any idea when <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/36934\">#36934</a> will be merged?  That will impact cslib which uses <code>Language</code> a lot.</p>",
        "id": 584546152,
        "sender_full_name": "Ching-Tsun Chou",
